# Fly deploy configs are machine-local. Only fly.toml (prod) is public.
# fly.staging.toml, fly.dev.toml, and any other per-environment overrides
# stay out of the public tree — they name internal hosts + secret refs.
fly.staging.toml
fly.dev.toml
fly.*.toml
!fly.toml
